OL,5,G1135 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FClergyman Ken is planning a
OL,7,     Fpermanent move to Larnaca in
OL,8,     FCyprus, so he can be closer to his
OL,9,     Ffriends. With a budget of #80,000,
OL,10,     Fcan Jasmine Harman find the answer
OL,11,     Fto his prayers?
OL,12,G1235 A Place in the Sun
OL,13,     FWith retirement approaching,
OL,14,     FLesley and Ken have downsized
OL,15,     Ftheir UK house to buy a holiday
OL,16,     Fhome on the Caribbean island of
OL,17,     FBarbados. Craig Rowe shows them
OL,18,     Fwhat their #350k can buy.
